menu "x84-digidash"

    config X84_SIMULATION
        bool "Simulated data instead of the CAN bus"
        default n
        help
            Shows the three scenarios of the design, alternating every 12 s, with RPM and speed changing on every
            frame (the worst case to render), instead of reading the car. For the bench: without the car, the CAN
            bus shows "--" and "SEM CAN". sdkconfig.simulation turns it on (see README.md).

endmenu
